6
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.400
nada

7
00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:13.980
No dependo de la apariencia para ganarme la vida.

8
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.340
¿Daniel?

9
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.160
Oye,

10
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:22.900
no te muevas.

11
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.340
Hay algo en tu cara.

12
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.540
Esta bella dama,

13
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.400
debe ser

14
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.700
